  "visual_review": "Personally inspected both 1200x1000 contact sheets and the 1281x266 closeup. All 18 held/worn scenes are present and clean. Every one of the 15 Hardened Glowstone held/worn cases is brighter with native emission and loses its material glow in the alpha-zero control; ordinary Glowstone and lantern controls remain stable. The native placed block is brighter than ordinary Glowstone and the alpha-zero block under matched BSL settings, while the face border, tool shapes, armor silhouettes, and cube geometry remain recognizable. No red/cyan or unloaded-scene artifacts are present. The auditor authenticated pinned Fabric Loader 0.19.2, current QA and production classes, exact 13-map alpha-only delta, matched settings, shader toggling, commands and acknowledgements, and the reviewed four-distance companion-on profile."
